<title>USA: GOLF-FOURTH-ROUND LEADERS AT LAS VEGAS INVITATIONAL.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FOURTH-ROUND LEADERS AT LAS VEGAS INVITATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaders after the fourth round</p>
<p>of the $1.65 million Las Vegas Invitational golf tournament on</p>
<p>Saturday  (players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>264 Ronnie Black 64 65 69 66</p>
<p>265 Davis Love III 66 67 64 68</p>
<p>266 Dave Stockton Jr. 67 68 67 64, Fred Couples 66 67 66 67</p>
<p>267 Dan Pohl 68 66 70 63, Fred Funk 63 66 68 70</p>
<p>268 Kelly Gibson 69 69 65 65, Mark Calcavecchia 72 67 65 64,</p>
<p>Tiger Woods 70 63 68 67, Keith Fergus 62 70 67 69, Rick Fehr</p>
<p>64 62 69 73</p>
<p>269 Paul Goydos 67 71 66 65, Dudley Hart 71 67 67 64, John</p>
<p>Cook 72 64 65 68</p>
<p>270 Phil Mickelson 68 67 68 67, Stewart Cink 70 66 67 67,</p>
<p>Scott McCarron 68 66 69 67, Lee Janzen 66 65 70 69, David</p>
<p>Ogrin 69 63 67 71</p>
<p>Additional international scores:</p>
<p>271 Vijay Singh 66 68 71 66</p>
<p>273 Stuart Appleby (Australia) 73 67 66 67</p>
<p>274 David Frost (South Africa) 65 71 71 67</p>
<p>278  Fulton Allem (South Africa) 73 66 66 73</p>
<p>281 Craig Parry (Australia) 68 67 72 74</p>
